    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, the Run phase will ensure the long-term maintenance and support of The expected solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) past experience working with public sector clients, such as regional councils and national professional orders, and particularly The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) reference project with a regional hospital group, has equipped The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) with valuable knowledge in addressing the specific requirements of healthcare institutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will leverage valuable knowledge in addressing the specific requirements of healthcare institutions to customize The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) solution for The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) clinical-administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of consortium partners, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will collaborate with OuraneCloud to provide a secure and sovereign hosting environment, and Ligeo Santé to ensure seamless integration with The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) existing health information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) partnership with a French public AI research laboratory will enable The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) to stay at the forefront of retrieval-augmented generation and explainability technologies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure that all requirements are met, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will establish a joint steering committee with The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB), meeting monthly, and an operational committee meeting fortnightly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) single point of contact, the project director, will be responsible for coordinating all aspects of this project, and The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) RACI matrix will guarantee clear roles and responsibilities within the project team." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "With The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) have sufficient capacity to manage this project effectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) change-management and training resources will also be available to support The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) staff during the deployment and adoption of The expected solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) strategy is designed to deliver a high-quality AI assistance solution that meets The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) objectives, while ensuring efficient project management and effective collaboration with all stakeholders." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide response times below 2 seconds, with an availability target of 99.9% including outside office hours (24/7 services), API integration with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), support for health interoperability standards (HL7 / FHIR), national health identifier (INS), and national framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé / DMP)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting must be performed on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED, or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times below 2 seconds: FULLY COVERED. our platform's common single-document queries are below 2 seconds at p95 latency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Availability target of 99.9% including outside office hours (24/7 services): FULLY COVERED. our have an availability target of 99.9% and operate 24/7 on the appropriate hosting tier." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API integration with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI)): FULLY COVERED. our architecture includes standard connectors and custom adapters for SIH and DPI integration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7 / FHIR): FULLY COVERED. our have production-ready FHIR HL7 connectors for main resources, with extended resource coverage on the roadmap. national health identifier (INS) support: FULLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform's includes national health identifier (INS) support as part of Our platform's health interoperability capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "National framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé / DMP) alignment: FULLY COVERED. our are aligned with these frameworks through our partnership with Ligeo Santé and our FHIR HL7 connector coverage." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent: FULLY COVERED. our sovereign HDS tier hosting option is provided by OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and EU-only." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist the drafting of clinical and administrative content, notably discharge summaries and medical reports (comptes-rendus), medical correspondence and patient letters, administrative documents and dossier syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture leverages our Atelier platform, with our Atelier platform retrieval-augmented generation capabilities, hosted on the sovereign HDS tier of OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified, and EU-only to meet all requirements. our Atelier platform will utilize Kubernetes for containerization and ensure model-agnostic support for various model options." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API design will follow an API-first approach, allowing for seamless integration with existing work environments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Identity management will be handled through SSO protocols like SAML and OIDC, along with user directories such as LDAP and Entra ID." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must guarantee strict compliance with GDPR, health data processed as special-category data (GDPR Art. 9), medical confidentiality preserved, data hosted exclusively within the EU, no transfer outside the EU, sensitive data protected (encryption, pseudonymisation)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The infrastructure hosting the solution must hold French Hébergeur de Données de Santé (HDS) certification." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security and regulatory compliance measures will we implement to ensure adherence to these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee strict compliance with GDPR, particularly for special-category health data as per Article 9, weimplemented several security and regulatory compliance measures." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we hosting infrastructure is operated by OuraneCloud, which holds the SecNumCloud qualification and HDS certification, ensuring that we data hosting complies with French regulations for health data. operated means all data are hosted exclusively within the EU, with no transfers outside the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data protection, we utilize encryption in transit via TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we employ pseudonymisation to protect sensitive information. we key management is based on an the EU-based infrastructure, further ensuring compliance with GDPR requirements. we also adhere to principles of data minimization and have configurable retention policies in place, allowing for strict control over how long data are kept." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generated content must be adapted to the clinical/administrative context and conform to expected quality standards. 3.3 Dossier-handling assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Tenant isolation is ensured through strict logical separation between client corpora on a per-engagement basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "From a regulatory standpoint, we experience delivering solutions under GDPR, especially for public-sector and health clients dealing with special-category health data, positions we well to handle these requirements. we are familiar with frameworks such as CNIL guidance, HDS reference framework, and HAS guidance on AI in healthcare, which helps we maintain high standards of compliance. we product, Atelier, is designed with explainability and auditability in mind, supporting a posteriori review and traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our product, Atelier also supports medical confidentiality, ensuring that sensitive health information is handled appropriately." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, as an ISO 27001 and ISO 27701 certified organization since 2023, with we scope including development, delivery, and operations, we have robust security controls in place, including secure software development lifecycle practices, vulnerability management, incident response planning, and segregation of duties." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This comprehensive approach ensures that we are well-equipped to handle the sensitive nature of health data while complying with all relevant regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, explainability and traceability of AI outputs, no automation of clinical or medico-administrative decisions without explicit validation by a qualified professional, and positioning as an assistance tool not requiring medical-device qualification (CE marking / MDR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we compliant with these regulatory obligations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, we Legal function is responsible for monitoring GDPR compliance, including Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we Security & Compliance function maintains regulatory compliance in the health deployment context, specifically obligations related to medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context." ;
