        ex:hasText "Given obligations related to medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context, potential legal risks that should be flagged include non-compliance with GDPR, particularly regarding explainability and traceability of AI outputs, as well as potential mispositioning of we tool as requiring medical-device qualification." ;
