        ex:hasText "As for cost-optimization strategies, the authority's favour configurations that protect the gross margin and recurring-cost predictability. the authority's can propose using the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model, which are more cost-efficient on the recurring side than the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference. the authority's finance role works closely with the architect to keep the proposed configuration within the budget envelope while preserving an acceptable margin." ;
