    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address these requirements, we will leverage we Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities, which enable we to retrieve relevant information from internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulations. we approach will involve a combination of hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, and structured extraction to provide accurate and context-specific information." ;
