    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting medical and administrative documents, we will utilize template-guided drafting capabilities, which can assist in generating discharge summaries, medical correspondence, and other administrative documents. template-guided drafting capabilities, which can assist in generating discharge summaries, medical correspondence, and other administrative documents will be supported by we ability to recall applicable rules during dossier handling and provide action and verification suggestions to ensure compliance with institutional protocols and regulations." ;
