        ex:hasText "To support handling dossiers and facilitate collaboration and continuity of care, we will implement features such as dossier-context continuity, which allows for structured handover summaries that enable professionals to efficiently take over in-progress dossiers. dossier-context continuity, which allows for structured handover summaries that enable professionals to efficiently take over in-progress dossiers will be complemented by we ability to surface relevant institutional rules, protocols, and regulations within the context of an active dossier." ;
