    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure the quality and relevance of The solution, we will follow an iterative approach that involves corpus selection and curation with client experts, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and a thorough evaluation loop." ;
