        ex:hasText "The quality of we answers will be measured using a labelled evaluation set built with the client, focusing on metrics such as groundedness, relevance, and factual support. we model selection principle will trade performance against explainability and sovereignty, choosing between a sovereign European open-weight model or top-tier proprietary models via API, depending on the specific engagement requirements. we will also prioritize human oversight, embedding human oversight into we workflow to ensure that professionals validate the assistant's proposals, consistent with HAS guidance." ;
