    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, what is The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) overall strategy for managing this project, and how will The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) ensure that all requirements are met? our overall strategy for managing this projecttalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) project involves utilizing a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement. a Hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement will enable The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) to deliver The expected solution in an efficient and structured manner, ensuring that all requirements are met." ;
